sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title: Add scene to Whisparr
  participant U as User
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API as Express API
  participant WH as Whisparr
  participant LS as Local Stash

  U->>UI: click Add
  UI->>+API: POST whisparr scenes
  alt Whisparr not configured
    API-->>UI: 400 error
  else configured
    API->>+WH: POST /movie
    Note right of WH: monitored, searchForMovie
    WH-->>-API: movie created
    API->>API: patch movie cache
    API-->>-UI: 200 movie
  end
  UI->>+API: GET scenes status
  API->>LS: find scene by stashId
  API->>WH: movie and queue lookup
  API-->>-UI: downloading or monitored
